OL,4,BBowen brothers needed extra protection 
OL,5,Bafter threats                          
OL,6,GJames Bowen is the latest jockey to    
OL,7,Gconfirm he has received death threats  
OL,8,Gfrom angry punters, revealing both he  
OL,9,Gand brother Sean needed extra          
OL,10,Gprotection after an incident last year.
OL,12,FThe 25-year-old said the pair required 
OL,13,Fadditional security going between the  
OL,14,Fpaddock and weighing room at Ffos Las  
OL,15,Fin October 2025 after threats were     
OL,16,Fmade.                                  
OL,18,FEarlier this week, Nico de Boinville   
OL,19,Fsaid losing on an odds-on favourite at 
OL,20,FPlumpton had led to a threat against   
OL,21,Fhis life being phoned in to Nicky      
OL,22,FHenderson's yard.                      
